% A negated atom sharing no variable with the rest of the body guards
% the whole rule: it holds for every row or for none. A variable that
% only the negated atom mentions stands for any value.

input(1) .
input(2) .
flag(off) .

allowed(?x) :- input(?x), ~flag(on) .
blocked(?x) :- input(?x), ~flag(?any) .
